  "reason": "Source-registered: every data input lands in a pin flop (gv_q/gf_q/gi_q/gd_q, isv_q/isd_q) and every output leaves a flop (xw_d = dsfd_pq_lx xw register, xw_v = its bit 0, fault register); recipe-3 pin_regs would add a second unpriced stage on the ring-to-buffer and frame-word paths (the slice contract: inputs land in a flop, outputs leave a flop)."
 },
