 "structural_change": "S81-SLICE (stream 0cm, 10-17): new leaf, the slice x streamer. 24 x ot_sram_1r1w_128x256 x buffer (one write port per ring source, skewed BF16 columns), 7 x ot_rom_4096x72_m8 (phase 0, stream 0..3, calendar action/time; images identical in all slices), production static PQ stream path (ot_s81_pq_ctl_static_native pruned of VM/AQ/return counting), fixed per-slice ring-arrival delay, dsfd_pq_lx verbatim + output relay. Floorplan v2 (583 x 480 um): one 8-macro abutted column per ring source directly above that source's third of the S-face g_d pins; ROMs in two W columns; std-cell band L-shaped along S (beat pin flops, write rotator, read muxes, controller) and E (frame-word pin flops); clock entry at the SE corner of the band; kept select copies (ot_v41_kreg) for every wide mux select; 8 reset regions.",
